      "statement": "Streaming has two modes: V1 (callback-based, triggered by _StreamingCallbackHandler or stream=True, driven by _should_stream()) routes through _stream()/_astream() yielding ChatGenerationChunk; V2 (protocol events, triggered by _V2StreamingCallbackHandler, driven by _should_use_protocol_streaming()) routes through _stream_chat_model_events() or bridges _stream() via chunks_to_events().",
